land have made me soft.

270
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:45,720
I'll give you five minutes.

271
00:16:48,680 --> 00:16:52,160
If you can't deal with the
situation here in five minutes

272
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:55,800
then I'll kill every last one of you.

273
00:16:58,180 --> 00:16:59,940
