277
00:17:13,860 --> 00:17:16,625
All we have to do is take
care of this one guy.

278
00:17:17,260 --> 00:17:18,090
That's all.

279
00:17:18,173 --> 00:17:21,059
Five minutes will be more
than enough time for them.

280
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:30,517
