288
00:17:51,620 --> 00:17:53,280
How about a thanks?

289
00:17:54,260 --> 00:17:55,090
Yeah.

290
00:17:56,520 --> 00:17:57,350
Yeah.

291
00:17:57,433 --> 00:17:58,263
