403
00:25:58,180 --> 00:26:00,237
If you want my fortune, you can have it.

404
00:26:00,320 --> 00:26:02,637
Take it all and leave
this village right now.

405
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:07,620
I'm begging you I will gladly
accept your fortune miss Kaya.

406
00:26:07,820 --> 00:26:08,650
Thank you

407
00:26:10,500 --> 00:26:14,740
But I want more you see simply
acquiring wealth isn't enough.

408
00:26:16,600 --> 00:26:18,680
More than anything else!

409
00:26:20,440 --> 00:26:22,940
What I want is peace.

410
00:26:23,480 --> 00:26:24,820
You want peace?

411
00:26:25,680 --> 00:26:28,620
Yes, just peace peace of mind.

412
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:32,417
It's simple really I I have
spent the last three years

413
00:26:32,500 --> 00:26:35,853
earning the trust of the entire
village and to be honest,

414
00:26:35,960 --> 00:26:39,725
I find this new sense of peace
and tranquility quite comforting.

415
00:26:40,600 --> 00:26:45,820
When my plan comes to fruition, I will
live with this sublime peace of mind.

416
00:26:54,380 --> 00:26:55,210
Yes.

417
00:26:55,293 --> 00:26:58,977
The glorious comfort of a peaceful life.

418
00:26:59,060 --> 00:27:01,937
