Miss Kaya, these things will happen.

422
00:27:17,040 --> 00:27:18,620
No, you can't.

423
00:27:20,020 --> 00:27:21,640
You just can't be.

424
00:27:23,580 --> 00:27:24,940
Run away, Kaya.

425
00:27:25,120 --> 00:27:26,557
There's no use talking to him.

426
00:27:26,640 --> 00:27:28,052
Please, get out of here.

427
00:27:29,060 --> 00:27:30,760
You're not Pahator.

428
00:27:31,360 --> 00:27:33,060
No, you're not.

429
00:27:34,980 --> 00:27:35,810
Kaya.

430
00:27:36,360 --> 00:27:39,060
