things we went through?

436
00:27:52,060 --> 00:27:54,380
We spent so much time together.

437
00:27:55,840 --> 00:27:58,700
Even before your dear
sweet parents passed away.

438
00:28:00,380 --> 00:28:02,200
You were more than my master.

439
00:28:02,520 --> 00:28:03,932
You were my best friend.

440
00:28:04,840 --> 00:28:06,260
So much time.

441
00:28:09,980 --> 00:28:15,520
So many memories together we suffered
and together we rejoiced like family.

442
00:28:19,520 --> 00:28:23,977
I took you on shopping trips to
the city I looked after you so

443
00:28:24,060 --> 00:28:29,240
diligently when you were ill and we
used to talk for hours and hours.

444
00:28:32,600 --> 00:28:35,857
Kaya listen to me I was devoted to you

445
00:28:35,940 --> 00:28:39,697
for so long for so

446
00:28:39,780 --> 00:28:43,240
very long I endured it.

447
00:28:45,060 --> 00:28:48,777
I quietly suffered so
that today I could end

448
00:28:48,860 --> 00:28:52,220
