before some snot-nosed little girl.

451
00:29:08,420 --> 00:29:11,500
It went against every fiber of my being.

452
00:29:17,440 --> 00:29:18,700
Damn you!

453
00:29:19,260 --> 00:29:22,740
Can you understand the depth
of these daily insults?

454
00:29:23,460 --> 00:29:28,460
