456
00:29:49,720 --> 00:29:52,580
Usopp, I owe you for
hitting me. Let's get even.

457
00:29:53,160 --> 00:29:54,740
Oh no, Usopp!

458
00:29:55,220 --> 00:29:59,040
If I recall, you hit me as
hard as you could, right?

459
00:29:59,940 --> 00:30:00,770
Oh

460
00:30:22,600 --> 00:30:27,720
He hates getting hit that much he's
about to have a really bad day!

461
00:30:31,080 --> 00:30:32,497
As a kid,

462
00:30:32,580 --> 00:30:38,437
I never stopped Searching
for a great treasure I had

463
00:30:38,520 --> 00:30:42,337
a map in my mind That I

464
00:30:42,420 --> 00:30:45,617
knew would lead me I had to

465
00:30:45,700 --> 00:30:51,077
find my way to that place
Before someone could beat me

466
00:30:51,160 --> 00:30:57,600
The promised land was in my
grasp And I wouldn't let go

467
00:30:59,840 --> 00:31:01,320
La, la, la,

468
00:31:01,680 --> 00:31:04,400
la My only dream La, la,

469
00:31:04,640 --> 00:31:11,080
la, la, la I won't stop
chasing it until it comes true!

470
00:31:13,300 --> 00:31:19,677
But if the world ever
changes I call out your name

471
00:31:19,760 --> 00:31:26,137
We can return to the time
when everything's the same!

472
00:31:26,220 --> 00:31:30,540
As long as I'm with you,

473
00:31:30,760 --> 00:31:35,037
my memories won't fade Waiting

474
00:31:35,120 --> 00:31:38,580
for that one true dream?
